[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    14[0m:[38;5;10m[49m So the library has **no error enum, no error-return macro, no sentinel return, no
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    15[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `assert`, no null check and no numeric range check**. Every public function
