[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    17[0m:[38;5;10m[49m parameter anywhere, so there is no null-pointer rejection to reproduce. The
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    18[0m:[38;5;10m[49m complete rejection surface is the 12 rows below.
