[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    154[0m:[38;5;10m[49m (`…806 → -2`, `…807 → -1`, `…808 → -1`, `-…807 → 1`, `-…808 → 0`, `-…809 → 0`)
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    155[0m:[38;5;10m[49m and is now covered by `driver_cli::row10_out_of_range_operands` and
